OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after man's body
OL,4,Afound in woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives are investigating the
OL,7,F"unexplained" death of a man found dead
OL,8,Fin a Sheffield woodland.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Ecclesall Woods
OL,11,Fat 18:46 BST on Wednesday by the
OL,12,Fambulance service, following reports of
OL,13,Fa man's body being discovered.
OL,15,FAn area of the woodland, near the
OL,16,Fjunction of Abbey Lane and Whirlowdale
OL,17,FRoad, has been cordoned off, with
OL,18,Fofficers expected to remain at the
OL,19,Fscene throughout Thursday
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
